#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# 签名材料一律不进仓库, 只放 GitHub Secrets (CI 里 base64 还原):
# key.properties 与 *.keystore / *.jks 已由 android/.gitignore 覆盖,
# 这里补 iOS 侧以及任何目录下漏网的证书文件与口令文件
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.provprofile
*.p8
*.cer
**/key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# CI 本地复现用的临时物
.ci-tmp/
